    {
      "id": "intro",
      "scope": "intro",
      "title": "Guided tour of the site",
      "file": "intro.mp3",
      "duration": 123.6,
      "chars": 1864,
      "hash": "978fc81f54c09af6",
      "captions": [
        {
          "t0": 0,
          "t1": 1.68,
          "text": "Welcome to the labs!"
        },
        {
          "t0": 1.68,
          "t1": 6.48,
          "text": "Here, we don’t look at machines from far away: we take them apart."
        },
        {
          "t0": 6.48,
          "t1": 9.12,
          "text": "This is a wheel, seen at an angle."
        },
        {
          "t0": 9.12,
          "t1": 10.8,
          "text": "It turns slowly."
        },
        {
          "t0": 10.8,
          "t1": 15.04,
          "text": "In a lab, you can walk around it, isolate a part, cut it open."
        },
        {
          "t0": 15.04,
          "t1": 17.44,
          "text": "Then everything comes undone."
        },
        {
          "t0": 17.44,
          "t1": 23.24,
          "text": "The twenty-six little cups fan out, the hub lifts off, the shaft slides out of its seat…"
        },
        {
          "t0": 23.24,
          "t1": 28.64,
          "text": "Every part has its own sheet: an overview, its specifications, how to look after it."
        },
        {
          "t0": 28.64,
          "t1": 31.92,
          "text": "And once it is all back together, the water returns."
        },
        {
          "t0": 31.92,
          "t1": 38.08,
          "text": "A live simulation: you change the head, the flow or the wind, and read what comes out."
        },
        {
          "t0": 38.08,
          "t1": 39.52,
          "text": "Here are the labs."
        },
        {
          "t0": 39.52,
          "t1": 45.28,
          "text": "Each one is a site of its own: you open it, you play, and you come back here to pick the next."
        },
        {
          "t0": 45.28,
          "t1": 46.72,
          "text": "Which one first?"
        },
        {
          "t0": 46.72,
          "t1": 51.44,
          "text": "The first follows a small mountain stream, from the intake all the way to the battery,"
        },
        {
          "t0": 51.52,
          "t1": 53.6,
          "text": "through a wheel of little cups."
        },
        {
          "t0": 53.6,
          "t1": 59.52,
          "text": "The second is a hydraulic ram: a pump with no motor, which lifts spring water far higher,"
        },
        {
          "t0": 59.68,
          "t1": 62.48,
          "text": "using only the energy of the water that falls."
        },
        {
          "t0": 62.48,
          "t1": 64.72,
          "text": "The third is a wooden wind turbine,"
        },
        {
          "t0": 64.84,
          "t1": 71.28,
          "text": "carved by hand: it charges a battery when the wind picks up, and steps out of the way when it gets too strong."
        },
        {
          "t0": 71.28,
          "t1": 76,
          "text": "The fourth is an Archimedes screw: a small head of water fills its buckets,"
        },
        {
          "t0": 76.08,
          "t1": 79.04,
          "text": "the screw turns, and electricity follows."
        },
        {
          "t0": 79.04,
          "t1": 82.88,
          "text": "More will follow, from the solar water heater to the sand battery."
        },
        {
          "t0": 82.88,
          "t1": 86,
          "text": "No dates: a lab ships when it is ready."
        },
        {
          "t0": 86,
          "t1": 90.72,
          "text": "Inside every lab, you find the same bearings: views in three dimensions,"
        },
        {
          "t0": 90.76,
          "t1": 96.4,
          "text": "a sheet for every part, an assembly guide, a simulation, drawings, short lessons."
        },
        {
          "t0": 96.4,
          "t1": 98.96,
          "text": "And sometimes, a voice like this one."
        },
        {
          "t0": 98.96,
          "t1": 101.84,
          "text": "A word of honesty, said just once."
        },
        {
          "t0": 101.84,
          "t1": 105.04,
          "text": "These labs are independent educational reconstructions,"
        },
        {
          "t0": 105.12,
          "t1": 110.16,
          "text": "inspired by public videos: neither official drawings nor makers’ products."
        },
        {
          "t0": 110.16,
          "t1": 113.76,
          "text": "The sources are credited here, and inside every lab."
        },
        {
          "t0": 113.76,
          "t1": 116.08,
          "text": "This voice is a synthetic voice."
        },
        {
          "t0": 116.08,
          "t1": 122.72,
          "text": "And if you build for real, take the usual precautions: electricity, water and fire have their rules."
        },
        {
          "t0": 122.72,
          "t1": 123.6,
          "text": "Over to you!"
        }
      ],
